WEBVTT

00:02.330 --> 00:06.290
You were not the one Amir Gaul chose.

00:06.600 --> 00:11.900
Sara, it was Zed, the baby in your womb.

00:12.570 --> 00:14.540
So what?

00:15.440 --> 00:18.880
If Zed were to die, that power would...

00:18.880 --> 00:20.850
What?!

00:21.650 --> 00:23.550
Zed...

00:23.550 --> 00:25.990
My Zed...

00:25.990 --> 00:28.620
Dear, dear Zed...

00:29.160 --> 00:32.790
I love you...

00:34.060 --> 00:36.360
...and I despise you!

00:50.650 --> 00:58.250
Umareta machi o tooku hanarete atashi wa

00:58.250 --> 01:01.420
Utatte iru

01:01.420 --> 01:09.060
Yowai kokoro mo yureru omoi mo poketto ni

01:09.060 --> 01:12.330
Shimaikonde

01:12.330 --> 01:22.910
Te no naru hou e michi naru michi e

01:22.910 --> 01:28.350
Ayumou

01:28.350 --> 01:33.760
Susumou

01:33.760 --> 01:38.590
Dare ka no tame ja naku

01:38.590 --> 01:44.070
Aru ga mama hokoreru you ni

01:44.070 --> 01:49.540
Yoake ni taiyou ga noboru you ni

01:49.540 --> 01:54.780
Atashi wa melody o kizamu

01:54.780 --> 01:58.800
Hakanakutomo tsuyoku

02:00.450 --> 02:03.980
Atashi wa ikite yuku

02:09.890 --> 02:13.620
Episode 44
An Unbreakable Spell

02:15.160 --> 02:17.630
Please, stop, Mom!

02:18.500 --> 02:20.030
Zed...

02:20.030 --> 02:22.340
My Zed...

02:22.340 --> 02:24.810
Dear, dear Zed!

02:29.080 --> 02:33.540
Now, be a good boy and give me Amir Gaul!

02:41.060 --> 02:43.180
Hand over Amir Gaul!

02:47.100 --> 02:48.600
Stop this, Sara!

02:48.600 --> 02:50.130
Zed!

02:50.130 --> 02:51.760
Zed...

02:57.840 --> 02:59.470
Zed!

03:11.320 --> 03:13.950
Shadin...

03:19.530 --> 03:21.130
What the heck?

03:21.130 --> 03:24.700
This is the key spirit Shadin!

03:24.700 --> 03:26.400
A key spirit?

03:26.400 --> 03:28.040
From Sagiri?

03:28.040 --> 03:31.010
You little brat!

03:31.010 --> 03:32.540
Shadin!

03:32.540 --> 03:35.010
Shadin...

04:04.370 --> 04:06.000
Mom...

04:06.470 --> 04:08.100
Mom!

04:08.540 --> 04:10.340
You must not go!

04:11.780 --> 04:14.910
You must not follow her, Zed.

04:17.590 --> 04:21.890
I swear I'll get Amir Gaul!

04:25.260 --> 04:30.060
But I can't take that brat's key spirit lightly.

04:38.070 --> 04:41.370
So, I haven't recovered enough
strength yet, then?

04:44.350 --> 04:46.910
You must not meet with Sara!

04:46.910 --> 04:48.450
Why not?!

04:48.450 --> 04:51.850
She is no longer your mother!

04:51.850 --> 04:55.860
Unable to forget the joy she once
felt gaining Amir Gaul,

04:55.860 --> 04:59.330
she's transformed into a
pleasure-seeking demon.

04:59.330 --> 05:02.460
To get Amir Gaul...

05:03.600 --> 05:06.230
...she might kill even you.

05:08.370 --> 05:10.470
Why?

05:10.470 --> 05:13.110
She's Zed's mother, isn't she?

05:13.110 --> 05:15.010
Why would she do that?

05:15.010 --> 05:18.480
That is how fearsome the spirits are.

05:18.480 --> 05:22.440
Sara has succumbed to the spirits'
temptation to evil.

05:23.890 --> 05:26.650
Amir Gaul's power is enormous,

05:26.650 --> 05:31.790
and because of that, its temptation to evil is
strong, and its darkness is bottomless.

05:33.700 --> 05:35.660
So what?

05:37.170 --> 05:40.370
I want to see my mom and talk to her!

05:40.370 --> 05:42.400
I have to!

05:42.400 --> 05:44.370
Out of the question!

05:48.080 --> 05:51.050
If you insist on going,

05:51.050 --> 05:53.670
then defeat me first!

05:54.350 --> 05:56.150
Old man...

05:58.250 --> 06:00.090
We'll advance on Templar.

06:00.090 --> 06:03.560
We're going to seize Amir Gaul.

06:03.560 --> 06:05.990
Naturally, I have no objections.

06:05.990 --> 06:09.730
Will you move the whole army there and
take it down in one fell swoop?

06:09.730 --> 06:11.700
No need.

06:11.700 --> 06:16.170
Our objective is to capture the
key spirit Amir Gaul.

06:16.170 --> 06:18.510
Then, my unit will be enough.

06:18.510 --> 06:20.470
I can't leave this to you.

06:21.110 --> 06:25.240
You have already lost
to Amir Gaul's wielder once.

06:25.610 --> 06:28.780
As a warrior, I want to fight him!

06:28.780 --> 06:31.320
How meaningless.

06:31.320 --> 06:33.220
If our objective is accomplished,

06:33.220 --> 06:36.320
the very act of fighting becomes unnecessary.

06:36.320 --> 06:37.790
Xeem...

06:37.790 --> 06:41.000
You have no warrior blood in you!

06:41.000 --> 06:42.000
What tripe...

06:42.000 --> 06:43.630
What?!

06:43.630 --> 06:45.500
Hmm?

06:45.500 --> 06:47.270
Well, if it isn't Gitra!

06:47.270 --> 06:49.100
How unusual.

06:49.100 --> 06:52.010
What could have brought you here?

06:52.010 --> 06:55.710
Are the key spirits really so important?

06:55.710 --> 06:57.280
Of course.

06:57.280 --> 06:59.410
We'll assemble all the key spirits,

06:59.410 --> 07:02.520
gain the enormous power of Great Tusker,

07:02.520 --> 07:05.720
and then Tusk will rule over all the lands.

07:05.720 --> 07:09.520
Is there anyone who has seen
this Tusker's power?

07:10.490 --> 07:14.000
I believe the current decline of the Tuskan race

07:14.000 --> 07:15.800
is actually a product of inbreeding, and...

07:15.800 --> 07:18.230
Great Tusker will be resurrected!

07:18.230 --> 07:23.670
And I know that his power will be far
grander than our wildest dreams!

07:23.670 --> 07:29.310
If nothing else, it is fact that there are
six key spirits in this world.

07:29.310 --> 07:32.770
It's only natural for us to ascertain their power.

07:33.550 --> 07:36.950
There are people who are suffering for that goal.

07:36.950 --> 07:39.520
You mean Mirred?

07:39.520 --> 07:41.320
Mirred is our savior.

07:41.320 --> 07:44.660
Don't forget that, Gitra.

07:44.660 --> 07:50.790
All this is her fate, as the one born
with a key spirit within her.

07:55.640 --> 07:57.430
I can't hear it...

07:58.770 --> 08:02.230
I can't hear the pipe organ today.

08:10.080 --> 08:11.350
Cut it out, Zed!

08:11.350 --> 08:13.150
You too, Master Zico!

08:16.590 --> 08:18.830
You've improved, Zed,

08:18.830 --> 08:20.950
but you have a long way to go.

08:30.770 --> 08:32.400
Rambos!

08:34.680 --> 08:36.300
Fyron!

08:55.000 --> 08:56.130
What's the matter?

08:56.130 --> 08:58.600
Is this all you've got?

09:04.810 --> 09:06.670
Fine, then I'll use Amir Gaul.

09:06.670 --> 09:08.300
No!

09:16.420 --> 09:18.040
Zed!

09:35.900 --> 09:37.700
Hey, are you okay?

09:45.410 --> 09:46.610
What happened?

09:46.610 --> 09:48.410
Is something the matter?

10:06.370 --> 10:08.340
So, you're awake?

10:10.200 --> 10:11.540
Old man!

10:11.540 --> 10:13.770
You sit tight here.

10:13.770 --> 10:17.110
It's my fault that Sara was lost to evil.

10:17.110 --> 10:19.240
You leave this to me.

10:20.150 --> 10:21.420
Cut the crap!

10:21.420 --> 10:23.750
This is between me and my mom!

10:23.750 --> 10:26.020
It's got nothing to do with you!

10:26.020 --> 10:28.190
Sara is a monster now.

10:28.190 --> 10:30.160
You're no match for her.

10:30.160 --> 10:33.560
Monster or not, she's my mom!

10:33.560 --> 10:36.360
She's my mom...

10:38.030 --> 10:41.990
Even so, I can't let you out of here.

10:42.800 --> 10:45.110
I'll be the one to settle this.

10:45.110 --> 10:46.900
You stop right there, old man!

10:47.640 --> 10:49.270
Damn it...

10:50.340 --> 10:52.470
All right, here I come...

10:54.180 --> 10:55.480
Over here!

10:55.480 --> 10:56.620
This way!

10:56.620 --> 10:58.450
No, over here!

10:58.450 --> 11:00.750
Let's see...

11:02.560 --> 11:04.290
Now, don't tease.

11:04.290 --> 11:07.590
If you don't talk or clap, I have no chance!

11:10.160 --> 11:12.270
Who are you?

11:12.270 --> 11:15.390
Would you care to explain this?

11:19.010 --> 11:21.010
What a creepy appearance.

11:21.010 --> 11:23.110
I'll assume it was your doing then.

11:23.110 --> 11:25.740
Someone who would harm
fragile damsels like those

11:26.110 --> 11:28.080
needs to be punished.

11:28.720 --> 11:30.750
A shard caster?

11:30.750 --> 11:33.550
I don't want to fight unnecessarily right now.

11:34.260 --> 11:36.050
Hold it!

11:37.560 --> 11:38.760
Master Robès...

11:38.760 --> 11:40.190
Oh, my lady.

11:40.190 --> 11:41.200
Hang in there.

11:41.200 --> 11:43.320
I'm right here.

11:48.740 --> 11:51.530
Just who was she?

12:08.220 --> 12:12.350
Noah got us this cake.

12:46.360 --> 12:48.160
Mom!

12:53.930 --> 12:55.730
Mom...

12:57.200 --> 12:59.830
Wow, this looks so good!

13:00.370 --> 13:04.010
I don't know how good it will taste,
but go ahead and dig in.

13:04.010 --> 13:06.710
Did you make all of this, Roya?

13:06.710 --> 13:08.680
Yep, pretty much.

13:09.480 --> 13:12.750
I wonder if Zed is hungry?

13:12.750 --> 13:15.550
Good thinking, I'll take him some.

13:16.190 --> 13:18.060
You wait here, Sagiri.

13:18.060 --> 13:19.690
Okay!

13:22.530 --> 13:24.800
Sages of Templar, on behalf of the Seekers,

13:24.800 --> 13:30.170
I offer you my deepest apologies
for the great damages

13:30.170 --> 13:34.710
that our emissary has inflicted on your nation.

13:34.710 --> 13:37.380
In fact, I would like to come to Templar
to apologize in person,

13:37.380 --> 13:40.280
and to bring back our princess.

13:40.280 --> 13:44.020
By princess, do you mean that Sagiri girl?

13:44.020 --> 13:48.920
Naturally, there is no problem with
you coming here in person.

13:48.920 --> 13:53.730
More importantly, there are many
things we'd like to know.

13:53.730 --> 13:57.860
To us, the Seekers are a mystery.

13:58.600 --> 14:01.540
Just who are your people?

14:01.540 --> 14:04.500
I'd like you to start by telling us that.

14:10.640 --> 14:15.750
Sara, I'm the one who made you
the way you are now.

14:15.750 --> 14:20.750
I swear I'll banish the demon
lodged in your heart,

14:20.750 --> 14:23.220
for Zed's sake as well as yours.

14:26.730 --> 14:29.800
Roya, let me out of here!

14:29.800 --> 14:34.500
Master Zico told me you mustn't
meet with your mother.

14:34.500 --> 14:36.200
What the hell does he know?!

14:36.200 --> 14:38.140
This is my problem!

14:38.140 --> 14:39.270
But...

14:39.270 --> 14:41.480
I want to see Mom.

14:41.480 --> 14:44.080
Mom wants that too!

14:44.080 --> 14:45.650
Zed...

14:45.650 --> 14:47.440
Please, Roya.

14:50.620 --> 14:55.420
We've just received word from the Seekers that
an envoy will be coming to bring you home.

14:55.660 --> 14:57.930
There's no need to worry now.

14:57.930 --> 14:59.720
Now, if you'll excuse me.

15:00.730 --> 15:02.530
They're coming for me.

15:09.940 --> 15:13.740
If I go back there,
I won't be able to look for Noah!

15:22.850 --> 15:24.480
Ow...

15:25.490 --> 15:27.610
Zed! Roya!

15:30.930 --> 15:33.430
Hey, will you really be okay?

15:33.430 --> 15:35.500
Yeah, she's my mom.

15:35.500 --> 15:37.790
If I have a talk with her, I know she'll understand!

15:38.330 --> 15:42.400
Before now, I've never had a real
conversation with Mom!

15:42.400 --> 15:44.530
Now, I can finally do that!

15:53.350 --> 15:58.310
Well now, it's not too often you see a woman
walking alone around here.

15:59.590 --> 16:03.220
Say, want to have some fun with us?

16:03.220 --> 16:04.260
I see...

16:04.260 --> 16:06.060
Yes, please.

16:08.760 --> 16:09.900
Don't move!

16:09.900 --> 16:13.030
I'll be taking all your vitality!

16:13.330 --> 16:15.130
Stop this!

16:17.540 --> 16:19.170
Zico!

16:26.110 --> 16:29.740
Give it a rest, Sara.

16:40.830 --> 16:42.460
Xeem!

16:42.830 --> 16:46.030
If you're going to Templar, then take me with you!

16:46.030 --> 16:49.370
Capturing Amir Gaul is our objective right now.

16:49.370 --> 16:52.340
I have no intention of starting a war with Templar.

16:53.940 --> 16:55.710
Xeem, wait!

16:55.710 --> 16:58.880
Our objective is the key spirits and them alone.

16:58.880 --> 17:01.850
It's not that Zed boy.

17:03.280 --> 17:06.580
We'll make Amir Gaul ours.

17:11.990 --> 17:13.620
Damn it...

17:21.270 --> 17:22.900
Monadi!

17:25.070 --> 17:26.700
Fyron!

17:45.030 --> 17:46.650
Pronimo!

18:01.610 --> 18:02.740
Why?

18:02.740 --> 18:05.540
How can a lowly spirit like Fyron
cause me such trouble?!

18:08.180 --> 18:11.790
You can't make full use of a key spirit!

18:11.790 --> 18:14.390
Especially not Amir Gaul!

18:14.390 --> 18:17.830
You are not a chosen one!

18:17.830 --> 18:19.690
Go back to Calm!

18:19.690 --> 18:21.330
It's a little late to say that!

18:21.330 --> 18:24.360
You're the one who made me like this!

18:24.360 --> 18:26.330
It's all your fault, you bastard!

18:26.670 --> 18:29.170
That's why I'm fighting you right now.

18:29.170 --> 18:32.340
I'll cut away all the chains of your terrible past!

18:32.340 --> 18:34.610
That's my responsibility!

18:34.610 --> 18:36.580
Just butt out!

18:47.520 --> 18:49.990
You need to give up, Sara!

18:55.900 --> 18:57.520
Oh no!

19:01.100 --> 19:04.230
I'll kill her and take her key spirit.

19:04.770 --> 19:06.740
Sara, don't!

19:10.280 --> 19:12.450
Withstand that, Zico!

19:12.450 --> 19:16.580
While you still hold out, the girl stays alive.

19:17.650 --> 19:20.280
Let her go, Sara!

19:52.220 --> 19:55.020
You're looking pretty ragged after
a piddling little attack.

19:55.690 --> 19:58.490
You've gotten old, Zico.

19:59.660 --> 20:01.790
Mom, stop!

20:06.400 --> 20:08.030
Zed!

20:11.370 --> 20:13.410
Take care of Sagiri and the old man.

20:13.410 --> 20:15.030
Right!

20:21.950 --> 20:23.520
Mom...

20:23.520 --> 20:28.860
We haven't had any contact between us
that you could call " mother and son, "

20:28.860 --> 20:32.660
but I'll never forget your smile that day!

20:39.500 --> 20:42.040
Please, stop doing this stuff!

20:42.040 --> 20:44.440
Go back to normal!

20:44.440 --> 20:46.240
Give him back.

20:49.280 --> 20:52.250
Give back my Amir Gaul!

20:55.750 --> 20:57.080
Why?!

20:57.080 --> 21:02.820
I was so happy that you were safe,
and that I got to see you!

21:02.820 --> 21:04.620
But you...

21:05.460 --> 21:08.590
You don't know that rapture.

21:09.560 --> 21:13.400
You've got no business having Amir Gaul.

21:13.400 --> 21:16.530
I'm the one who truly deserves him,

21:17.300 --> 21:22.610
because I love him better than anyone else.

21:23.880 --> 21:27.480
Amir Gaul is everything to me.

21:27.480 --> 21:29.420
He's my life.

21:29.420 --> 21:34.220
Amir Gaul is the one I love.

21:41.400 --> 21:44.020
You care about him that much?

21:45.300 --> 21:48.100
You want him that much?!

21:49.840 --> 21:52.110
Then, I'll give him to you.

21:52.110 --> 21:53.900
You can have him!

21:54.710 --> 22:00.170
Good boy, Zed, that's the son I love.

22:09.660 --> 22:12.120
My Amir Gaul...

22:22.070 --> 22:23.770
You're...

22:23.770 --> 22:25.870
The Tuskans, eh?!

22:25.870 --> 22:31.000
How about you two hand over your key spirits?

22:39.620 --> 22:44.920
Wazurawashii toko kara hanarete

22:45.860 --> 22:49.230
Habatakitakatta dake

22:49.230 --> 22:54.430
Mou kodomo ja nai no ni to

22:54.430 --> 23:00.070
Nando jibun o shikatta darou

23:01.140 --> 23:05.980
Yakusoku sareta basho made

23:05.980 --> 23:11.620
Hitasura susumu dake sa

23:11.620 --> 23:17.220
Bokura no tsubasa wa

23:17.220 --> 23:24.000
Honmono no totemo totemo kirei na hane dakara

23:24.000 --> 23:33.740
Donna hageshii ooki na kaze ni mo makenai

23:33.740 --> 23:43.820
Tooku e tooku e hitasura tobun da

23:43.820 --> 23:49.560
Hora mou kaze ni natte

23:49.560 --> 23:57.930
Anna ni namida o koraeta hi mo waraeru kara

23:59.930 --> 24:03.890
Sekai no hate made

24:17.720 --> 24:20.950
Next Time
The Girl Confined to the Castle

24:17.980 --> 24:20.950


Next time, "The Girl Confined to the Castle"
